    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "If the defendant in an action in personam , other than an action mentioned in Rule 3(1), fails to file and serve such notice within the prescribed time or states in the notice that the defendant does not intend to contest all or some of the claims"

