    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Issue of a warrant of arrest takes place upon its being sealed by an officer of the Registry"

-- src:4619 | (6) Every affidavit required by paragraph (3) must state — ( a )
-- src:4620 | the name, address and occupation of the applicant for the warrant;
