-- src:4651 | subject to Rule 2(7), when the defendant files a notice of intention to contest or not contest in the action even though the originating claim is not duly served on the defendant, the originating claim is deemed to have been duly served on the defendant on the date on which the defendant filed the notice of intention to contest or not contest.
