GIVEN `the date on which the endorsement was made` IS A MAYBE DATE
      `the date on which the defendant filed the notice of intention to contest or not contest` IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
`o 33 r 7(3) the day the originating claim is deemed duly served` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the date on which the endorsement was made`
    WHEN JUST e THEN
        CONSIDER `the date on which the defendant filed the notice of intention to contest or not contest`
        WHEN JUST f THEN IF e AT MOST f THEN JUST e ELSE JUST f
        WHEN NOTHING THEN JUST e
    WHEN NOTHING THEN `the date on which the defendant filed the notice of intention to contest or not contest`

