    IF `the service is of a warrant of arrest or originating claim in an action in rem against freight or cargo or both` AND `the cargo has been landed or transhipped`
    THEN IF `service is by placing the warrant or originating claim for a short time on the cargo and, on removing it, leaving a copy of it on the cargo` OR (`the cargo is in the custody of a person who will not permit access to it` AND `service is by leaving a copy of the warrant or originating claim with that person`)
         THEN JUST TRUE
